      "text": "5/ THE ALGO TAPE\n\nThe week's largest TWAP executions were all crypto majors: the biggest fill was a $37.07MM $ETH buy worked over 5m to 100% completion, set against two large $BTC sells of $36.71MM (10m) and $28.13MM (5m), both fully filled, and a $17.06MM $SOL buy. This is directional size that never touches the visible order book; the HIP-3 equity and commodity perps do not appear in the top algo prints this week.",
